  "remediation_note": "To meet all five conditions, the record must include a substantive findings section that documents the investigator's evaluation of evidence, credibility determinations, and the specific reasoning linking (or distinguishing) the protected activity, temporal proximity, and job selection decisions. Reference to the ROI must be supplemented with summary of key findings of fact and application of relevant legal standards.",
